<title>USA: First Virginia to sell three branches.</title>
<headline>First Virginia to sell three branches.</headline>
<dateline>FALLS CHURCH, Va. 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Virginia Banks Inc is selling three bank branches in southwestern Virginia under an agreement the company entered with the U.S. Department of Justice and the Federal Reserve Board.</p>
<p>The divestiture follows the company's acquisition of Premier Bankshares Corp, First Virginia Banks said in a statement on Thursday</p>
<p>Financial terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
